n69@potsdam.eduMail:  Anthony Morin  P.O. Box 466  Potsdam, NY 13676I am sorry, but this something I have to, I cried about this, and hada bible to my heart conforting me on what to do...I have to destory my past, because it is destory my future....I really can't think any more to say, mainly when you are crying writing thisI have nothing against you guys, But I am upset about time I spent on here...  honestly, I wish I was never introduce to Muds..I can't change what was, but I have the power to change what isor my will be will not be what I like it to be...SO, a farewell to you all.... and wish me luck with my battle..Anthony \"Nylakoorub\" Morin**solita**To: sylvynSubj: hiya!Date: Feb  3How are you Chris?!?!?  Remember me?  Just writing to say hiand hoping all is going well with you and your fiance' =)I'm doing good and so is Grimlock =)  That poor guyhasn't had net access at home since about october of last year*chuckle*  plus he's too busy to do much from work...he does have an email account tho:it's jameskj@juno.com and he'd love to hear from ya =)mines fcalvo@cms.cc.wayne.eduso, when you have a few free minutes =)  let us know how you're doin!  *huge hug*  and best wishes!-Felicia n James-**nylakoorub**To: sylvynSubj: HelloDate: Jun 22Hi, how things going?I was checking a bug on my clearing, but I also decided to check out therainforest.  It looks good, I also like the addition monsters likethe Tarantula and the other feline type monsters.Keep up the good work.Nylakoorub**lynne**To: sylvynSubj: hi thereDate: Dec 10Hey, how are you? I'm not sure you'd remember me, but I played three yrsago and left about 2 yrs ago. Well I just wanted to say hi.please write back if you remember. :)Lynne**"
